in the year 2022 smartphones are  competing with cinema cameras and gaming  pcs we'll run through a list of the  elite flagship devices and decide which  one of them is 2022's best smartphone  let's dive in  first on the list we have a brand with a  fanbase so loyal you would think elon  musk owned the company if you want to be  simple about it the xiaomi 12 pro is a  solid flagship phone and this after the  spectacular run its predecessor had we  can all recall that xiaomi launched the  first commercially available smartphone  that charges at 120 watts and a phone  with an almost one inch camera sensor  the mi 11 ultra a year after and every  serious device had adopted these  features its new offering the 12 pro  sports a fingerprint resistant glass  black design a 6.73 inch 2k amoled  display coupled with quad speakers that  have support for dolby atmos its  interiors are powered by a snapdragon 8  gen 1 chip that is matched with 12  gigabytes of ram and 128 or 256  gigabytes of storage it's dual sim if  that's your shtick but you might be  disappointed to know that the storage is  non-expandable nevertheless the device  has an excellent triple 50 megapixel  camera system that gives crisp and  natural photos the device itself is  powered by a 4 600 milliamp hour battery  that will get you through a day on full  charge at a price point of 999 dollars  it is definitely worth your buck  oneplus 10 pro  next on the list we have a brand from  china that has stepped up its game ever  since it was first launched in 2013.  oneplus 10 pro the first thing that  attracts people to a brand new phone is  its looks and while the 899 dollar  oneplus 10 pro might not be the best  2022 device it has an incredibly sleek  design but looks are not enough for this  list and that is why the oneplus 10 pro  also has three rear cameras that place  it above the average smartphone its main  ultra wide and telephoto lens that all  come to a whopping 150 megapixels makes  it easy to see what the fuss is about  well it is the incredibly powerful  qualcomm processor the snapdragon 8 gen  1. this processor also ensures that  whatever pictures you take will be  seamless on its 6.7 inch corning gorilla  glass screen but even though this might  be the best device the company has made  it is not the best out there not when  there is the  sony xperia pro i  can you spend 1 800 on a phone the sony  xperia pro i might not appeal to  everyone but that doesn't take anything  from the fact that it is one of the best  camera phones of 2022. in fact the i in  xperia pro i stands for imaging which  pays homage to sony's alpha mirrorless  interchangeable lens cameras let's just  say that the xperia is a phone attached  to a camera it sports an image sensor  that enables outstanding low light  performance and high dynamic range while  its triple 12 megapixels might seem like  a downer to the uninitiated megapixels  mean nothing if your sensor is small i  hope the oneplus team is taking notes  the xperia pro i's rear cameras use  three glass lenses from zeiss and its  main 24 millimeter lens has dual  aperture which allows its user to change  the depth of field more quickly to  create an authentic bokeh unlike the  digital software created bokeh effect  that other phones produce the xperia pro  i is the first smartphone in the world  that records 4k videos at  120fps and still preserves all 120  frames while other smartphones compress  4k video files the pro i ensures you  have 100 control in post-production its  other features include a 6.5 inch oled  display with 120 hertz refresh rate it  runs on a qualcomm snapdragon 888 5g  processor it comes with a standard 12  gigabytes of ram 512 gigabytes of  internal storage a micro sdxc card slot  and a 4 500 milliamp hour battery which  can be fast charged at 30 watts now  while these features sound nice it is  not a balanced device nowhere is  balanced as the  google pixel 6  google is a valuable brand so it makes  sense that they make valuable products  with the pixel 6 it appears they did  just that released in 2021 this simple  looking gadget remains relevant in its  second year priced at a reasonable 899  dollars the pixel 6 pro offers a 6.7  inch oled screen with 1440p wide  resolution that is powered by google's  new tensor chip a first of its kind  custom made processor that rivals  qualcomm snapdragon 888. aside from  powering the phone the tensor processor  also enables a myriad of ai based  customization to enhance features in the  camera speech recognition and gaming the  pixel 6 also comes equipped with 12  gigabytes of ram and 512 gigabytes of  storage but the true star of the show is  pixel 6 pro's cameras which are beyond  impressive remember what i said about  large sensors well pixel sensors are  large and they feature in its dynamic  trio of ultra wide wide and telephoto  cameras its main camera is 50 megapixel  its ultra wide is 12 megapixels and its  telephoto camera is an impressive 48  megapixels its video recording  capabilities are top of the shelf you  can shoot 4k at 60fps as long as you  want without the phone overheating and  it has an 8 megapixel front camera and a  94 degree field of view which means that  you can fit in everyone in your next  oscar-inspired selfie but this efficient  google offering cannot take the crown  because it pales in comparison to the  performance beast known as  the asus rog-6  if you think the asus rog 6 looks like a  sci-fi device that's because it is this  phone was created by a company that has  devoted everything towards creating the  perfect gaming pc and this phone is  meant to be a second cousin it has a 6.7  inch ammo led screen that can play  anything in the highest quality its  processor is an upgraded 5g qualcomm  snapdragon 888 its base ram is 8  gigabytes and its internal storage is  128 gigabytes it has an impressive 64  megapixel rear camera and a mind-blowing  24 megapixel selfie camera since this  device is all about gaming performance  which can cause it to become warm during  extended play the phone bundles a geeky  aero active cooler accessory its battery  is 6 000 milliamp hour and outlasts the  pixel 6 pro very easily with an  impressive graphics performance this  techie device is priced at a comfortable  1050  samsung galaxy s 22 ultra  there is no android device on the face  of the earth that defeats the galaxy s22  ultra this beast has an impressive 6.8  inch screen that sports a 1080p oled  screen with up to 120 hertz refresh rate  and is bright enough to use comfortably  in direct sunlight its oled screens have  rich blacks and vivid colors now the  only bummer that comes with the s22 on  the list is its battery and maybe that  is why it is not the number one on this  list but it compensates for that by  supporting 45 watt fast charging  boosting from zero to a hundred percent  in just an hour the s22 ultra uses the  snapdragon 8 gen 1 chipset which is  currently qualcomm's latest and greatest  processor for android phones it also  comes loaded with 8 gigabytes of ram and  performs better than some other brands  with ram overload the s22 ultra cameras  are on another plane of existence with a  108 megapixel stabilized main camera a  10 megapixel stabilized 10x optical zoom  telephoto a 12 megapixel ultra wide and  a 40 megapixel selfie camera video specs  are also phenomenal up to 8k at 24 fps  recording from the main camera and 4k at  30 or 60 fps from the front-facing  camera the galaxy s22 ultra's top  special feature is easily its integrated  s pen it has improved massively since  the note 20 ultra there's 70 less  latency when using it which means that  you might feel like you're writing or  drawing with an actual pen currently  priced at a hefty twelve hundred dollars  it might shake the bank but it is  definitely worth the buck moving ahead  it is time for the moment of truth the  best phone in 2022 is the iphone 13 pro  max don't act surprised apple has proven  time and time again why they're at the  front of the smartphone race while the  android fan club would argue that the  s22 is a better device it's just not  true and i'll show you why the iphone 13  pro max looks and feels sleeker than  ever before and its signature chunky  lenses give it that retro feel that some  might love it also sports an amoled  screen sprawled over a 6.7 inch display  but the true showstoppers are those  chunky yet elite cameras the iphone 13  pro max packs a trio of 12 megapixel  lenses that include main ultra wide and  telephoto cameras the 13 pro is a phone  for those with an eye for details while  most of the cameras on flagship devices  perform on the same impressive level in  normal or bright sunlight it is in low  light that the 13 pro defeats its rivals  unlike all of the megapixel chasing  android devices apple has stuck with 12  megapixels the same resolution it's used  since 2015's iphone 6s but it's expanded  its sensor to take in more light more  quickly than all other phone cameras the  iphone 13 pro max video capabilities max  out at 60 fps and 4k the 13 pro is the  only phone that offers a cinematic mode  for video that provides a rack focus  effect which means it automatically  switches subjects based on who is  speaking if sony xperia made a phone for  photographers iphone made a phone for  hollywood the iphone 13 pro 4500  milliamp hour battery is one of the best  among smartphones it even lasts two  hours longer than the s22 with its own  a15 bionic processor and with a starting  price of 1099  the iphone 13 pro is the best device of  2022 and there we have it not everyone  might agree with this list but i think  the evidence speaks for itself but what  do you think is the iphone 13 pro max  the best thing since sliced bread or did  i miss it also click the video on the  screen for more videos like this
 

